Author-Name: Sabourin, Anne
Author-Name: Segers, Johan
Author-Workplace-Name: Université catholique de Louvain, LIDAM/ISBA, Belgium
Title: Uniform concentration bounds for frequencies of rare events
Abstract: New Vapnik–Chervonenkis type concentration inequalities are derived for the empirical distribution of an independent random sample. Focus is on the maximal deviation over classes of Borel sets within a low probability region. The constants are explicit, enabling numerical comparisons.
Keywords: VC theory ; Concentration Inequalities ; Rare Events ; Empirical Process ; Non-parametric
